=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^2+4^2}
=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+2^{2}\cdot2^{2}}
=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+2^{4}}
=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+4^{2}}
=\sqrt{(z^{2})+1^{2}+4^{2}}
=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+2^{2}(z^{2}+1^{2})}

Επομένως:
[MATH |z+1|\cdot|z+1|=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+2^{2}\cdot(z^{2}+1^{2})}

Και:
[MATH |z+1|\cdot|z+1|=\sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+2^{2}\cdot(z^{2}+1^{2})}

Άρα:
[MATH \sqrt{z^{2}+1^{2}+2^{2}\cdot(z^{2}+1^{2})}
